  },
  {
    "insert": "\nWhen making claims, they should be either marked as such or proven (e.g. by referencing existing material). Especially in your motivation section, you lack some references (e.g. \"In Germany, one of the key reasons behind this...\"). Even though this is not the SOTA section, back up your claims with references"
